#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst:64 82d677a9a5d348dfbaaa867f350e03ee
msgid "**Name**: ``RCSBData_get_entry``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst:66 7d915c5ad2094e5c9db55baf183091ee
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get comprehensive structure metadata for a PDB entry "
"from the RCSB Data API. Returns experimental method, resolution, "
"deposition/release dates, polymer/nonpolymer entity counts, molecular "
"weight, assembly count, space group, and unit cell dimensions. This is "
"the direct REST endpoint for PDB entry details, complementing GraphQL-"
"based tools. Example: '4HHB' returns hemoglobin at 1.74A by X-ray "
"diffraction, deposited 1984-03-07, 2 polymer entities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst:70 92a7e9e741764251b26e2d6779e572bf
msgid ""
"``pdb_id`` (string) (required) PDB entry ID (4 characters). Examples: "
"'4HHB' (hemoglobin), '1TUP' (p53-DNA complex), '1M17' (EGFR kinase), "
"'6LU7' (SARS-CoV-2 main protease)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst:87 97c9747cab0f4fa3838d1037f19c93dd
msgid "**RCSBData_get_nonpolymer_entity** (Type: RCSBDataTool)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst:89 252ab300544240158f91fda2622a233e
msgid ""
"Get non-polymer entity (ligand/small molecule) details from a PDB "
"structure via the RCSB Data API..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst e14c0655c165446cb1950bc070bcd034
msgid "RCSBData_get_nonpolymer_entity tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst:95 3ef9b3378ebf4306b99b4670f1039159
msgid "**Name**: ``RCSBData_get_nonpolymer_entity``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst:97 32ffe2a882df4592b8316d384d0cff0b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get non-polymer entity (ligand/small molecule) details "
"from a PDB structure via the RCSB Data API. Returns the chemical name, "
"component ID, formula weight, chain assignments, and any DrugBank or "
"other database annotations. Useful for identifying what ligands, "
"cofactors, or ions are bound in a structure. Example: '4HHB' entity 3 "
"returns 'PROTOPORPHYRIN IX CONTAINING FE' (HEM), the heme group bound to "
"hemoglobin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst:101 1c9a817569674586b0d01fa06790d085
msgid ""
"``pdb_id`` (string) (required) PDB entry ID (4 characters). Examples: "
"'4HHB' (hemoglobin + heme), '3ERT' (estrogen receptor + tamoxifen), "
"'6LU7' (SARS-CoV-2 + inhibitor)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_data_tools.rst:104 21d378300d174171aaa2decbd23c9ab0
msgid ""
"``entity_id`` (string) (required) Entity ID within the PDB entry. Non-"
"polymer entities typically start after the polymer entities. Use "
"pdbe\\_get\\_entry\\_molecules or RCSBGraphQL\\_get\\_structure\\_summary"
" to discover entity IDs."
msgstr ""

